{"id": "3119408", "revid": "322190", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3119408", "title": "Mal\u00ee\u0219 i Karlson", "text": "Mal\u00ee\u0219 i Karlson (\u00een , \u00een traducere \u201eB\u0103ie\u021belul \u0219i Karlson\u201d) este un film de anima\u021bie sovietic din 1968, dup\u0103 trigolia omonim\u0103 a scriitorului Astrid Lindgren. A fost produs de Soiuzmultfilm.\nO continuare a filmului a fost lansat\u0103 \u00een 1970 \u2013 \"Karlson vernulsea\" (\"\u00ab\u041a\u0430\u0440\u043b\u0441\u043e\u043d \u0432\u0435\u0440\u043d\u0443\u043b\u0441\u044f\u00bb\" \u2013 \u201eCarlson s-a \u00eentors\u201d\")\".\nRezumat.\nUn b\u0103iat de \u0219apte ani se plictise\u0219te acas\u0103 de unul singur. Dintr-o dat\u0103, un b\u0103rbat cu o elice pe spate p\u0103trunde \u00een odaia lui prin geam. El se prezint\u0103 drept \u201eKarlson de pe acoperi\u0219\u201d. Cei doi leag\u0103 o prietenie."}
